        </div>
      </div>
      <div className="bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200">
        <h4 className="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">
          💡 Tips Pengembangan Diri
        </h4>
        <ul className="text-md text-gray-700 space-y-1">
          <li>
